The bug was caused by the lack of explicit specification of Locale and TimeZone when parsing and formatting milliseconds in the DateField class. This could lead to inconsistent behavior and incorrect date representations, especially when different locales or time zones were inadvertently used, resulting in potential errors in date handling.

